WEBVTT

act-1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.088
Your coding agent doesn't know why the code is the way it is.
You: Make the parser retry five times before failing.
Agent: Done. I changed the limit from three to five.

act-2
00:00:04.388 --> 00:00:08.088
Wordcell
Give your coding agent the reasons behind the code.

act-3
00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:12.638
Keep the decision and its reason in a Markdown file you own.

act-4
00:00:12.938 --> 00:00:17.538
Before the next edit, your agent finds the reason, even in different words.

act-5
00:00:17.838 --> 00:00:22.078
Keep using your agent, your editor and Git.

end
